/F2 12 Tf (SECTION 2: LABORATORY RECOGNITION SCHEME \(LRS\)) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Under LRS, private and public commercial laboratories are recognized by BIS to test samples.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Requirements for LRS Recognition:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (1. Accreditation by NABL \(ISO/IEC 17025\) for the relevant scope of testing.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (2. Adequate calibrated testing equipment complying with Indian Standards.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (3. Proficiency testing and participation in Inter-Laboratory Comparisons \(ILC\).) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (4. Transparent digital reporting linked directly with BIS Laboratory Information Management System \(LIMS\).) Tj T*
